        <mxCell id="kp_flusher" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;cortex_kb_flusher.py (NEW · ~150 LoC daemon)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;NDJSON fallback queue:&lt;br&gt;runtime/cortex/.kb_pending.ndjson + .kb_flushed.ndjson&lt;br&gt;Batch POST every 5s / 50 lines&lt;br&gt;T2/T3 non-blocking when Cortex unreachable&lt;br&gt;Crash recovery: read .kb_sid → resume + drain pending&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Supervised by robustness&lt;/b&gt; (reuses robustness_monitor.sh.example pattern)&lt;br&gt;CLOSE phase must wait flusher drain or explicit abort" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4ECFB;strokeColor=#7A1F8C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
