        <mxCell id="kp_pr" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;PR Monitor Client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;knowledge_plane/pr_monitor_client.py (urllib stdlib · no new deps)&lt;br&gt;REST: pr_list / pr_get / pr_search (Coordinator pre-warms pr_feed)&lt;br&gt;Backend: primus-cortex-pr-api (REST + MCP)&lt;br&gt;6 repos pre-indexed · 50Gi PVC cache · no GitHub API hits&lt;br&gt;ROCm/aiter · FlyDSL · hip · vllm · sglang · triton&lt;br&gt;commit-level file tree + PR baseline (cherry-pick analysis)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;specialist&lt;/b&gt; mounts MCP server with 12 readonly tools" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4ECFB;strokeColor=#7A1F8C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
