        <mxCell id="persist" value="&lt;b&gt;Persistence — $SESSION_DIR&lt;/b&gt; (default /workspace/hyperloom, flat layout; env: USER_DATA_PATH)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;state.json&lt;/b&gt; (atomic tmp+rename, Coordinator-only writer; v0.8 adds phase / phase_history / warm_start_* / explore_search / specialist_rounds / cortex_session_id / pending_kb_edges) · &lt;b&gt;storage/coordinator.db&lt;/b&gt; (SQLite WAL · events / tasks / leases [5 lanes] / cursors + schema_version)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;agents/{role}/{inbox,outbox}.jsonl&lt;/b&gt; · personas/ · checkpoints/ · findings/&amp;lt;ts&amp;gt;.json (RCA) · kb/ (Critic writes) · runs/&amp;lt;kind&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;task_id&amp;gt;/ · critic-workdir/&amp;lt;turn&amp;gt;/&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;v0.8 additions:&lt;/b&gt; runtime/cortex/.kb_pending.ndjson · .kb_flushed.ndjson · .kb_sid · specialist-workdir/&amp;lt;task_id&amp;gt;/{prompt, kb_snapshot, pr_feed, transcript, specialist_done}.json&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auxiliary module outputs:&lt;/b&gt; baseline_comparison/ · &lt;b&gt;breakdown v2&lt;/b&gt; (phase_timeline / specialist_runs / capability_summary(explore) / kb_provenance / attribution-by-phase) · roofline_integration.py" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6E9FF;strokeColor=#1F6AA8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1940" width="2220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="hw" value="&lt;b&gt;External resources&lt;/b&gt; · GPU pod (sglang / vllm — Magpie-wrapped, IR-4 kill+check_gpu_memory + IR-5 safe kill) · GEAK + OOB (claude / codex / cursor, Ray-scheduled via kernel-agent/tools/backends) · TraceLens CLI · InferenceX (GSM8K accuracy gate + B200 comparison) · &lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;primus-cortex cluster: kb-service (Cortex KB graph DB) + primus-cortex-pr-api (6-repo index · 50Gi PVC) · cross-cluster ingress / sidecar forwarder&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9D9D9;strokeColor=#5A5A5A;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
